 "remarks": "Former Model Home with four finished levels in Premier Ainslie Square! Welcome to 159 Colonial Rd #23, the flagship model home of Stamfords highly coveted Ainslie Square Community. Offering four fully finished levels, 3,000 square feet of luxury living space and low HOA fees, this turnkey home blends designer architectual details with modern high-effeciency performance. All within walking distance to downtown Stamford and Metro-North Train Station.    Key Property Features and Upgrades: Gourmet Chef's Kitchen that features Thermador Professional Series Stainless Appliances, sleek custom cabinetry, and open flow into main living areas.  Architectual Details: Custom shiplap accent walls. Warm Gas Fireplace. Custom fitted closet systems throughout. Expansive windows delivering exceptional natural light.   Four Finished Levels:  The main and second floor have a bright open floorplan, spacious bedrooms, and well-appointed baths.  A finished attic which features built-in-cabinetry and is perfect for a exective home office , play space or a media room,  Finished lower level recreation space equiped with a convenient half bath, flexible for guest overflow, fitness or entertainment.    Outdoor Space:  Private patio for alfresco dining or sitting out on a beautiful evening.   The home is energy-efficient for low utility and monthly operating expenses.",
